name latexdemo
category Package
revision 55265
shortdesc Demonstrate LaTeX code with its resulting output
longdesc The package provides configurable tools to print out LaTeX code
longdesc and the resulting output in the same document. It also supports
longdesc printing the result inside a conditional sequence; thus one may
longdesc suppress printing if the code would not compile.
